{"title":"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be positive integers for which\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2667fedb816b8f547fadbac7826d56f4598c3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2y = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" /><br /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/0307d490eba7aafead4c62294934b06921ab6b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 2z = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" /><br /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0b992f87177b9e3022cd0a3c9ef0e86e28edf1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z + 2x = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" /></center>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc8ba1464f944e344427a3009f6db3f0e272247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d08d179cd085260b0d61d0719f3b908d7df1199.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 80 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 100 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 120 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"339\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the first equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/c/ebc8b6d7238aab7e7c875fd97145bead2f4e5fef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 60 - 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this into the third equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836f8eb460e6c5269450e21137194bfce6cc1366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z + 2(60 - 2y) = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fa86bd2e48c825fbb68e965d89ddf8778da460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z + 120 - 4y = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/5/0c55f5656abcdfd3215d6f2723c59a7186d02043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z - 4y = 110 - 120 = -10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bbdf0a966d33a840d3e2bced4717abd34829ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 4y - 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into the second equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a115afe7377fa41ac46c1f93fbdd00f278fc4141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 2(4y - 10) = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/2/0823b48d6588b7f9c12acdd5bea093a924987da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 8y - 20 = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d4168250eccd9d00ed9e773e0967deb4f9c61c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9y = 70 + 20 = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839426de3cde9787dad9f99051ff9eacef5cad88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{90}{9} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c4d4d271c5c4dc51fcf7c5e2dee14a7c7fae47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2667fedb816b8f547fadbac7826d56f4598c3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2y = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/835d5fd73cd86608205d8c4956f5874b041ecfcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 20 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a531d594962c45ced7e8bf2a7726040e502c29a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 60 - 20 = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2afae2c0f2b22fb6a5ad988d9ad4de951de80f69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0b992f87177b9e3022cd0a3c9ef0e86e28edf1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z + 2x = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fca2eada06ac8fcca2d030c88c1a6bb26112644.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z + 80 = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbb3bb95f528607abf3029cbe774498af8103a78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 110 - 80 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/b/65be1e622fdac43a632d862d362a7c0b9532a2ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 40 + 10 + 30 = 50 + 30 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"371\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Without_Finding_Values_of_Variables.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Without_Finding_Values_of_Variables)\">Solution 2 (Without Finding Values of Variables)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Without Finding Values of Variables)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding all of the equations together, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f0c731112c7b76c38276d0e613e66c119f481c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2y + y + 2z + z + 2x = 60 + 70 + 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"331\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97a2d57037da69900643ca93461d2e442372b622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + 3y + 3z = 130 + 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/d/c4d6f85bc85c1d7bfde9c0b1a5e0b89f9453369d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(x + y + z) = 240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/8296c691b3a16e2e23e77966f7714fdc87dc6b9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = \\frac{240}{3} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC\" title=\"2023 CLMC\">2023 CLMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 CLMC Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canada_Lynx_Mathematical_Competition\" title=\"Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition\">Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node 